@startuml
title M3 account-aware screen flow (2026-10-18)
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
rectangle "Home /\nPublic catalogue; Start → guard" as Home
rectangle "Sign in /login\nPublic" as Login
rectangle "Create account /register\nPublic; success → login" as Register
rectangle "Recommendations /recommendations\nAuthenticated; ≤10 cards\nCold start / personalised / no-match\nLoading / empty / error / retry" as Recs
rectangle "Movie Preferences /preferences\nAuthenticated; save 1–5 genres" as Prefs
rectangle "Movie detail /movies/:movieId\nPublic; rating private\nNull-field and backdrop fallbacks" as Detail
rectangle "Popular /popular\nPublic; P1 S09" as Popular
rectangle "Explanation /about-recommendations\nPublic; implemented" as About
rectangle "Search /search\nPLANNED: no registered route\nUnknown URLs currently redirect to /" as Search #EEEEEE
rectangle "Profile /profile\nProtected placeholder\nReset API only; no reset control" as Profile #EEEEEE
Home --> Login : Sign in / guest Start
Login --> Register : Create an account
Register --> Login : 201 / Sign in
Login --> Recs : successful sign-in
Home --> Prefs : Start (signed in)
Home --> Recs : My recommendations (guarded)
Home --> Popular : Popular movies
Home --> About : How recommendations work
Home --> Detail : View details
Popular --> Detail : View details
Recs --> Detail : View details
Detail --> Recs : validated return context
Detail --> Popular : validated return context
Detail --> Home : catalogue context / direct load
Detail --> Login : guest rating CTA
Recs --> Prefs : Enter preferences / Change my genres / Edit preferences
Prefs --> Recs : committed save / Back to recommendations
Prefs --> Home : Browse the catalogue
Recs --> Home : Sign out / Browse the catalogue
Home ..> Search : M1 planned navigation; absent in M3
Home ..> Profile : M1 planned navigation; no visible home link
note bottom of Recs
  Protected entry checks GET /api/auth/me when unknown.
  Missing/expired/revoked session → /login; sign-out → /.
  Save success invalidates the account recommendation generation.
  S06 current-list genre filtering never writes preferences.
end note
note bottom of Profile
  Direct /profile is guarded, but only renders a placeholder.
  POST /api/me/profile/reset exists; UI is still pending.
end note
@enduml
